                "resource": "reciprocal-window-range",
                "note": "本题 $h(x)=x+\\frac4x$，$k=4$：最低点在 $x=\\sqrt4=2$，最小值 $2\\sqrt4=4$。"
              },
              "title": "画函数图像",
              "position": 4
            },
            "e_extremum": {
              "refs": [
                "skill-reciprocal-range"
              ],
              "tip": {
                "ref": "skill-reciprocal-range",
                "resource": "reciprocal-window-range",
                "note": "本题 $(1,2)$ 在最低点 $x=2$ 左侧，函数递减；两端都取不到，取值范围是 $(4,5)$。"
              },
              "title": "求取值范围",
