                "note": "本题斜率 $x^2-x+1=\\left(x-\\frac12\\right)^2+\\frac34>0$，$f(m)$ 递增，最大值是右端 $f(3)=3x^2-3x-3$。"
              },
              "title": "求最值",
              "position": 4
            },
